      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A winged undead creature with an arachnid appearance.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 23, touch 13; flat-footed 19 (-1 size, +4 dex, +10 natural)</p><p>hp 102 (12d8+48)</p><p>Fort +9, Ref +8, Will +8</p><p>Defensive Abilities Channel Resistance +4</p><p>DR 5/magic and silver</p><p>Immune Shadow, Undead traits</p><p>Resist Ice 10</p><p>Weakness Holy</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft., Fly 80 ft. (average)</p><p>Melee 2 Claws +17 (1d8+8), Bite +11 (1d8+8)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Rend (2 Claws, 1d8+12), Virus Fly</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 26, Dex 18, Con —, Int 10, Wis 10, Cha 16</p><p>Base Atk +9; CMB +18; CMD 32</p><p>Feats Alertness, Flyby Attack, Great Fortitude, Improved Initiative, Toughness, Weapon Focus (Claw)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +16, Fly +19, Perception +17, Sense Motive +17</p><p>Languages Abyssal</p>"
